codex
The repaired residual is now a genuine semantics branch: because the invariant framed an arbitrary local-map remainder, the prover had to consider `"$cells"` and closure-cell assignment, even though `move_one_ball` is a module-level capture-free function. I’m narrowing the invariant to the exact plain-frame domain with `"$cells" ∉ M`; this matches the call rule’s allocated frame and removes only an unreachable binding mode.
apply patch
